{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.92, "text": "I had been living in what we call like the spider house."}, {"start": 3.14, "end": 4.76, "text": "Like it was gross, lots of spiders everywhere."}, {"start": 5.7, "end": 7.6, "text": "But when we ended up getting married,"}, {"start": 7.9, "end": 10.5, "text": "we were again, starting a business"}, {"start": 10.5, "end": 12.26, "text": "and there's a lot of cost to that"}, {"start": 12.26, "end": 13.76, "text": "and we didn't have a lot of money."}, {"start": 14.42, "end": 16.92, "text": "So we house hacked while renting."}, {"start": 17.96, "end": 20.74, "text": "Basically all the time we would get a place"}, {"start": 20.74, "end": 21.98, "text": "that was comfortable for us,"}, {"start": 21.98, "end": 24.84, "text": "but then we would kind of partition it off"}, {"start": 24.84, "end": 26.82, "text": "so that we would have either friends,"}, {"start": 27.4, "end": 30.04, "text": "usually friends because it was such close quarters,"}, {"start": 30.36, "end": 32.98, "text": "live with us and help cover the cost of that rent."}, {"start": 33.9, "end": 35.98, "text": "And so we got kind of used to living with people."}, {"start": 36.68, "end": 38.84, "text": "So when we got our first house, we did the same thing."}, {"start": 39.02, "end": 40.86, "text": "We took kind of got a larger house"}, {"start": 42.12, "end": 44.26, "text": "and partitioned it to be a fourplex."}, {"start": 44.7, "end": 46.38, "text": "But I didn't want anyone living with us."}, {"start": 46.46, "end": 47.84, "text": "By then we had little babies"}, {"start": 47.84, "end": 50.08, "text": "and so I wanted it to be separate."}, {"start": 50.2, "end": 53.42, "text": "So we would just take a room and put a microwave in it"}, {"start": 53.42, "end": 56.92, "text": "and a mini fridge and we would want to make sure"}, {"start": 56.92, "end": 58.24, "text": "that there was their own bathroom"}, {"start": 58.24, "end": 59.7, "text": "so we weren't sharing those things."}, {"start": 60.3, "end": 61.84, "text": "But in the house that our first house,"}, {"start": 62.02, "end": 63.14, "text": "we were able to do that."}, {"start": 63.42, "end": 66.26, "text": "So it was a fourplex and it was,"}, {"start": 66.32, "end": 67.46, "text": "we got the nicest part of it."}, {"start": 67.52, "end": 68.6, "text": "Like we got the main kitchen,"}, {"start": 68.86, "end": 70.8, "text": "there was a playroom that we were able to turn into,"}, {"start": 71.04, "end": 73.68, "text": "two rooms, we put one child in the attic,"}, {"start": 73.8, "end": 75.14, "text": "we made that really cute."}, {"start": 76.1, "end": 77.16, "text": "But house hacking, yeah."}, {"start": 77.38, "end": 79.56, "text": "So whether you're renting and house hacking"}, {"start": 79.56, "end": 81.56, "text": "to be able to save money for that down payment"}, {"start": 81.56, "end": 83.44, "text": "or doing it on your first house,"}, {"start": 83.98, "end": 85.08, "text": "it is one of the best ways"}, {"start": 85.08, "end": 86.84, "text": "because you're just getting so much income."}, {"start": 87.0, "end": 88.98, "text": "And we were living in a very nice place for almost free."}], "words": [{"w": "I", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.18}, {"w": "had", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.74}, {"w": "been", "start": 0.74, "end": 0.9}, {"w": "living", "start": 0.9, "end": 1.1}, {"w": "in", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.42}, {"w": "what", "start": 1.42, "end": 1.66}, {"w": "we", "start": 1.66, "end": 1.78}, {"w": "call", "start": 1.78, "end": 2.0}, {"w": "like", "start": 2.0, "end": 2.24}, {"w": "the", "start": 2.24, "end": 2.4}, {"w": "spider", "start": 2.4, "end": 2.64}, {"w": "house.", "start": 2.64, "end": 2.92}, {"w": "Like", "start": 3.14, "end": 3.18}, {"w": "it", "start": 3.18, "end": 3.26}, {"w": "was", "start": 3.26, "end": 3.42}, {"w": "gross,", "start": 3.42, "end": 3.66}, {"w": "lots", "start": 3.86, "end": 3.92}, {"w": "of", "start": 3.92, "end": 4.08}, {"w": "spiders"